        _v10_hero("Global Monetary Policy Observatory", "Hawk/Dove Monitor — G10 Central Banks", "Desk-style policy dashboard: central-bank cards, hawk/dove composite, ranked policy rates, balance-sheet impulse and speeches tape. Click a card to open the bank workstation.")
