#      Bank detail -> header -> summary strip -> Overview/Scorecard/Speeches/Meetings.
# - Improve data parity for structural central-bank rates using the public RoboMacro page snapshot.
# - Keep HTML/CSS for visual structure, Streamlit buttons for stateful navigation, Plotly for charts.
# ============================================================

