                _v16_html("<div class='m20-method'>A rate decision creates a dated policy impulse. Official speeches create separate dated impulses scored from full text when available. Signals decay through time, then receive small transparent rate-level and three-month momentum anchors. This approximates the original workflow without claiming access to its proprietary NLP history.</div>")
